Subject: [PATCH 4/4] addition: sv_grenaderings (+ _amount) team-coloured glow
 on grenades; sv_sniperdot_teamcolour

Both off by default and server-side: render settings the engine already sends every client.
The dot uses the game's own white flare sprite tinted, since the stock dot is red.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
